# spec: set_anc on writes the enabled byte of CNC [1.5] back to 1 and keeps the current step.
# source: hardware report on firmware 1.8.2-11524+e0f7590: SETGET [1.5] 00 01 on 0b0000 returned 0b0001. Synthetic: step 3, to show the step is kept, following the same [steps, step, enabled] layout.
device nc700
call set_anc on
send 01 05 01 00
recv 01 05 03 03 0b 03 00
send 01 05 02 02 03 01
recv 01 05 03 03 0b 03 01
result ok
